{"v":4,"catch":"與強大的龍戰鬥，\n將您心愛的CELIA和她的家鄉從危險中拯救出來。","desc":"《DRAGON BUSTER》是NAMCO於1984年發行的動作遊戲。\n成為英雄“CLOVIS”，使用你的劍和魔法，前往龍山。\n在惡魔出沒的墓地和廢墟中戰鬥，擊敗強大的龍並拯救公主“CELIA”。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-12-09","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ce98ca6a9254a64e46cb0afa23cb17dbdf2ad64839076b32a13ae65589c6120d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bb937f63d145d32d574dfd37959112d17b416e9d50bca08f811cc65daa028c59.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/55459245af6c28b3c99b1489c21772ca3adb7cd63ce03050e1177f92478804b2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69dba76fef8c29219a960bcd308705a086c3fcb9e37f9027bcb0e2dcc4f56743.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac40fdbf341dfb36957b163ec5ba5147577c085558132a424d0bba4f4e4b2359.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f88ded3ce4be207aff04554c61bb368397bfd2d7d4431534baaf02ea609296e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100130015e0e000","dlc":[]}